<b><i>:: RePlay ::</i></b><br />
The reflagging keeps on coming, but with Real Life interruptions I am sure it will not be the last. Over the last week, since the last news post we have made a concerted effort to get the whole guild flagged to the same level, but alas RL has stopped that, myself have become a victim to its hold over EQ life, back to university.<br><br />
