I would like to remind everyone if they got a funny screenshot then to send me a tell and I will organise an e-mail address you can send it to.</span><span class="normal"><br>        </span></p>      </td>  </tr>  <tr background="barre1.jpg">     <td background="barre1.jpg">&nbsp;</td>    <td background="barre1.jpg"class="auteur">Euromancer</td>  </tr>  <tr><td colspan="2"><br></td></tr>    <td width="560" background="barre.jpg"><span class="GTitre">Another day in paradise</span><br> </td>    <td width="140" background="barre.jpg" class="date"><div align="right">24/09/2003</div></td>  </tr>  <tr>     <td bgcolor="#2F2828" colspan="2"><p><br>        <span class="normal">Once more into the breach dear friends once more, once more is all <b>MtS</b> needed to take Rallos Zek down.  No amount of fancy boomerang sword throwing chuns would keep <b>MtS</b> from killing this fool.  After pining him into the corner he hadn't a hope of seeing the next day alive.  Great work all but special thanks for great work had to go to the kite team for keeping the many adds off of the main raid and specially the MT, since the MT's HP will be pinging up and down.  This sort of great play has been happening many times in <b>MtS</b> and I here by introduce the <b>MtS</b> Great Play Certificate (PGC). These will not gain you extra DKP or loot but will show your sacrifice to help the guild.  So how can you obtain one of these little beauties I hear you ask.  Well I can state categorically there isn't and won't be a written rule to obtaining one of these puppies since there are just a bit of fun, however doing something that benefits the guild above yourself is a good start.  Doing your class job of say, feeding mana to others, ressing or CoTHing isnÅft grounds for great play since that's your job. PGC will only be given out on raids as a bit of fun and since I am fed up and people playing Gnome Ball with my corpse on raids.<br><br><br />
<center><br />
<img src="http://ion.dc.luth.se/pics/RallosDown.jpg"><br />
/roar pappy raised no fool</center><br><br><br />
<center><br />
<img src="http://ion.dc.luth.se/pics/TrollTank.jpg"><br />
Go Boladas...</center><br><br><br />
<br />
:: The last of the reflagging (maybe) ::<br><br />
<br><br />
With MM down again and Rallos dead, the majority of <b>MtS</b> have entered Elemental Planes. May this gnome say "Whoooooooooop". Grats all. it comes with the same refielf as killing EMP and finally getting into VT, so great work all.  To those of you in guild who are not up to date with the majority of the guild please make sure you update you profile on the roster and forum, I know this can be a bit of a pain but it helps us (Guild leader, officers, raid scouts etc) manage the guild and targets, thx.<br><br><br />
