us laugh.<BR><br />
<CENTER><IMG src="http://ion.dc.luth.se/pics/DeathToDoc.jpg"><BR>Dam foiled again too short to reach the handle.</CENTER><BR><BR><B>.: Saryrn :.</B><BR><A href="http://ion.dc.luth.se/dkp/plugins/stats/itemshot.php?s=&i=24647">Twin-blade of Sorrow</A> ñ <B>Saraleb & Yautja</B><BR><br />
<CENTER><IMG src="http://ion.dc.luth.se/pics/Uggie.jpg"><BR>Two-timing Ogre /pfft and I was going to introduce him to my sister.</CENTER><BR><BR>We took our first steps on the road of handing Lord Mithaniel Marr is ass, but instead he handed ours to us. Well him and the cat adds that needed a dam good shave. However MtS do not take a beating lying down. Thats right most of use took it across the head, splatter against the wall and generally flying across the room, the big bugger field goaled me back to HoH(a) /cry (I can see the pub from here, weeeeeee).<BR><BR>However we have longer memories than a zoo full of elephants that have only been fed stale peanuts for a year. This time we bitch slapped him into middle of next week and not before letting out the cartoon dog from Tom and Jerry to take care of the kit kits.<BR><BR><B>.: Lord Mithaniel Marr :.</B><BR><A href="http://ion.dc.luth.se/dkp/plugins/stats/itemshot.php?s=&i=15873">Valiant Belt of Fallen Heroes</A> ñ <B>Chazm</B><BR><A href="http://ion.dc.luth.se/dkp/plugins/stats/itemshot.php?s=&i=24647">Dart of Immobility</A> ñ <B>Vilina</B><BR><br />
